{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2109952103968059392", "3_2109952138571108353", "3_2109952171290849280", "3_2109952220842401792"]}, "author_id": "1103946421882011648", "created_at": "2026-10-13T10:20:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109952284129972613"], "id": "2109952284129972613", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\ud83d\udd10 Cyber Safety &amp; Security Awareness Programme at PM SHRI KV Karimganj in collaboration with Assam Police, Sribhumi Branch. Sh. K. Lamnganbi Singha, APS, DySP, and Sh. Sudarshan Das, SI, sensitised students of Classes VIII &amp; IX on digital arrest scams,safe internet practices. \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f https://t.co/mWsVaQypKk", "url": "https://x.com/kvkarimganj/status/2109952284129972613"}, {"author_id": "14891103", "created_at": "2026-10-13T09:49:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109944710987133314"], "id": "2109944710987133314", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Park Street er ki obostha!\n\nMy cabbie is lamenting, pujor shomoi kothao gari park kora jabe na. Park Street restaurants and businesses will suffer. Lanes choto hoye gyechhe. Traffic is already a nightmare.\n\nStraitjacketed like Sribhumi during Pujo.", "url": "https://x.com/TopSR/status/2109944710987133314"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-10-13T09:40:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109942245214335171"], "id": "2109942245214335171", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1824045769751666688", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2109942118735061220", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@IndianGeostrat Famous Kolkata Durga Puja pandals &amp; nearest metro:\n\nKumartuli Park - Shobhabazar Sutanuti\nBagbazar Sarbojanin - Shobhabazar Sutanuti\nSovabazar Rajbari - Shobhabazar Sutanuti\nAhiritola Sarbojanin - Shobhabazar Sutanuti\nCollege Square - Central\nSantosh Mitra Square - Central", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2109942245214335171"}, {"author_id": "37407255", "created_at": "2026-10-13T09:13:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109935488618647809"], "id": "2109935488618647809", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 288, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2109917786063663573", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "The chairman of Tala Prattoy Durga Puja is MLA Ritesh Tiwari https://t.co/ZiblCgwfmg", "url": "https://x.com/Aagan86/status/2109935488618647809"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2109931907232432128"]}, "author_id": "2016241079939694593", "created_at": "2026-10-13T08:59:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109931913867903001"], "id": "2109931913867903001", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 924, "like_count": 56, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 10}, "text": "\ud83d\udea8Union Home Minister Amit Shah to Arrive in Kolkata on Maha Saptami for 2-Day Durga Puja Visit:\n\nUnion Home Minister Amit Shah is scheduled to arrive in West Bengal on a two-day festive tour starting Saturday, October 17 (Maha Saptami), continuing his tradition of joining https://t.co/LoyCXRxZ4V", "url": "https://x.com/Banglar_Tintin/status/2109931913867903001"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2109927056658276352"]}, "author_id": "2086642811173253120", "created_at": "2026-10-13T08:40:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109927357700333738"], "id": "2109927357700333738", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\ud83d\udea8 \u0995\u09b2\u0995\u09be\u09a4\u09be\u09b0 \u099f\u09be\u09b2\u09be \u09aa\u09cd\u09b0\u09a4\u09cd\u09af\u09af\u09bc \u09a6\u09c1\u09b0\u09cd\u0997\u09be\u09aa\u09c1\u099c\u09cb\u09b0 \u0989\u09a6\u09cd\u09ac\u09cb\u09a7\u09a8 \u0995\u09b0\u09b2\u09c7\u09a8 \u09ae\u09c1\u0996\u09cd\u09af\u09ae\u09a8\u09cd\u09a4\u09cd\u09b0\u09c0 \u09b6\u09c1\u09ad\u09c7\u09a8\u09cd\u09a6\u09c1 \u0985\u09a7\u09bf\u0995\u09be\u09b0\u09c0\n\n\ud83d\udcdd \u099f\u09be\u09b2\u09be \u09aa\u09cd\u09b0\u09a4\u09cd\u09af\u09af\u09bc \u09a6\u09c1\u09b0\u09cd\u0997\u09be\u09aa\u09c1\u099c\u09cb\u09b0 \u0989\u09a6\u09cd\u09ac\u09cb\u09a7\u09a8\u09c0 \u0985\u09a8\u09c1\u09b7\u09cd\u09a0\u09be\u09a8\u09c7 \u0989\u09aa\u09b8\u09cd\u09a5\u09bf\u09a4 \u09ae\u09c1\u0996\u09cd\u09af\u09ae\u09a8\u09cd\u09a4\u09cd\u09b0\u09c0 \u09b6\u09c1\u09ad\u09c7\u09a8\u09cd\u09a6\u09c1 \u0985\u09a7\u09bf\u0995\u09be\u09b0\u09c0\u0964\n\n\ud83d\udd16#\u099f\u09be\u09b2\u09be_\u09aa\u09cd\u09b0\u09a4\u09cd\u09af\u09af\u09bc #\u09b6\u09c1\u09ad\u09c7\u09a8\u09cd\u09a6\u09c1_\u0985\u09a7\u09bf\u0995\u09be\u09b0\u09c0 #DurgaPuja https://t.co/sd7C1JwLAz", "url": "https://x.com/newsbanglalive4/status/2109927357700333738"}, {"author_id": "4764615733", "created_at": "2026-10-13T08:34:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109925700232954187"], "id": "2109925700232954187", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 177, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2109899588488577067", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "I cover 95% of the good ones (including all the big clubs and/or newly famous clubs).\n\nThere are many more like me.\n\nYou just have to be precise in your schedule, know your route, be prepared to walk 15-25km everyday, and have a lot of patience. https://t.co/u6FfNNXAmp", "url": "https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2109925700232954187"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2109919624959791105"]}, "author_id": "1348626540657983488", "created_at": "2026-10-13T08:22:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109922753038229810"], "id": "2109922753038229810", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 191, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\u09a6\u09c1\u09b0\u09cd\u0997\u09cb\u09a4\u09cd\u200d\u09b8\u09ac\u09c7 \u09ac\u09be\u0982\u09b2\u09be\u09af\u09bc \u0986\u09b8\u099b\u09c7\u09a8 \u0985\u09ae\u09bf\u09a4 \u09b6\u09be\u09b9\u0964 \u09a6\u09c1\u09b0\u09cd\u0997\u09be\u09aa\u09c1\u099c\u09cb\u09af\u09bc \u09e8 \u09a6\u09bf\u09a8 \u09ac\u0999\u09cd\u0997\u09c7 \u09a5\u09be\u0995\u09ac\u09c7\u09a8 \u0995\u09c7\u09a8\u09cd\u09a6\u09cd\u09b0\u09c0\u09af\u09bc \u09b8\u09cd\u09ac\u09b0\u09be\u09b7\u09cd\u099f\u09cd\u09b0\u09ae\u09a8\u09cd\u09a4\u09cd\u09b0\u09c0\u0964 \u09e7\u09ed \u0985\u0995\u09cd\u099f\u09cb\u09ac\u09b0 \u0995\u09b2\u0995\u09be\u09a4\u09be\u09af\u09bc \u0986\u09b8\u099b\u09c7\u09a8 \u09b6\u09be\u09b9\u0964 \u09ac\u09c7\u09b2\u09c1\u09a1\u09bc \u09ae\u09a0, \u09b6\u09cb\u09ad\u09be\u09ac\u09be\u099c\u09be\u09b0 \u09b0\u09be\u099c\u09ac\u09be\u09a1\u09bc\u09bf\u09a4\u09c7 \u09af\u09c7\u09a4\u09c7 \u09aa\u09be\u09b0\u09c7\u09a8 \u0985\u09ae\u09bf\u09a4 \u09b6\u09be\u09b9\u0964 \u099a\u09c7\u09a4\u09b2\u09be, \u09b6\u09cd\u09b0\u09c0\u09ad\u09c2\u09ae\u09bf-\u09b8\u09b9 \u0995\u09af\u09bc\u09c7\u0995\u099f\u09bf \u09aa\u09c1\u099c\u09cb \u09ae\u09a3\u09cd\u09a1\u09aa \u09aa\u09b0\u09bf\u09a6\u09b0\u09cd\u09b6\u09a8\u09c7\u09b0 \u09b8\u09ae\u09cd\u09ad\u09be\u09ac\u09a8\u09be\n\n \ud83d\udd34 \u09aa\u09cd\u09b0\u09a4\u09bf \u0998\u09a3\u09cd\u099f\u09be, \u09aa\u09cd\u09b0\u09a4\u09bf  \u09ae\u09bf\u09a8\u09bf\u099f, \u09aa\u09cd\u09b0\u09a4\u09bf https://t.co/XC5DcckJR1", "url": "https://x.com/BanglaRepublic/status/2109922753038229810"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2109916771658735616"]}, "author_id": "729184449997484032", "created_at": "2026-10-13T08:02:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109917786063663573"], "id": "2109917786063663573", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 2768, "like_count": 47, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 10}, "text": "'\u099f\u09be\u09b2\u09be \u09aa\u09cd\u09b0\u09a4\u09cd\u09af\u09af\u09bc' \u09a8\u09af\u09bc, \u09a8\u09be\u09ae \u09b9\u0993\u09af\u09bc\u09be \u0989\u099a\u09bf\u09a4 '\u099f\u09be\u0995\u09be \u09aa\u09cd\u09b0\u09a4\u09cd\u09af\u09af\u09bc'\n\u09ac\u09be\u09a3\u09bf\u099c\u09cd\u09af\u09c7\u0987 \u09ac\u09b8\u09a4\u09c7 \u09b2\u0995\u09cd\u09b7\u09cd\u09ae\u09c0, \u0986\u09b0 \u09ae\u09a3\u09cd\u09a1\u09aa\u09c7 \u098f\u0996\u09a8 '\u09aa\u09c7\u0987\u09a1' \u09a6\u09c1\u09b0\u09cd\u0997\u09be!' \u0990\u09a4\u09bf\u09b9\u09cd\u09af \u09b8\u0982\u09b8\u09cd\u0995\u09c3\u09a4\u09bf\u09b0  \u09ac\u09be\u0982\u09b2\u09be\u09b0 \u09aa\u09b0\u09bf\u09ac\u09b0\u09cd\u09a4\u09a8\u09c7 \u09a0\u09be\u0995\u09c1\u09b0 \u09a6\u09c7\u0996\u09be\u0993 \u098f\u0996\u09a8 \u09a8\u09cb\u0982\u09b0\u09be \u09ac\u09cd\u09af\u09ac\u09b8\u09be\u09b0 \u09b8\u09cd\u0995\u09bf\u09ae\u0964 \n\n\u0986\u09b0 \u0995\u09bf\u099b\u09c1 \u0985\u09a4\u09bf \u0989\u09ce\u09b8\u09be\u09b9\u09c0 \u09ae\u09be\u09a8\u09c1\u09b7 \u0986\u099b\u09c7 \u09af\u09be\u09b0\u09be \u09b8\u09c7\u0987 \u099f\u09bf\u0995\u09bf\u099f \u0995\u09c7\u099f\u09c7 \u09af\u09be\u099a\u09cd\u099b\u09c7\u0993 \u09a0\u09be\u0995\u09c1\u09b0 \u09a6\u09c7\u0996\u09a4\u09c7 \ud83d\ude0a https://t.co/6dSYV226ZY", "url": "https://x.com/barnali_iam/status/2109917786063663573"}, {"author_id": "4764615733", "created_at": "2026-10-13T08:01:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109917337239556442"], "id": "2109917337239556442", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 299, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2109908193166119009", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Durga Puja is the only public art festival in the world that is shown for free.\n\nSo, if there is a paid preview programme, I fully support it.\n\nHowever, the entire amount should go only to the artist, his team &amp; his labourers; not the club or its members. https://t.co/5DJCa1fEOa", "url": "https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2109917337239556442"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2109912971313106944"]}, "author_id": "1360821125152874500", "created_at": "2026-10-13T07:43:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109912981446561810"], "id": "2109912981446561810", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 225, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Union home minister Amit Shah to visit #Kolkata from October 17-18 in connection with Durga Puja #festival. \n\nHM #AmitShah likely to visit Belur Math, Deshbandhu Club at Bally in Howrah, 24 Pally, Chetla, Kolkata, Sovabazar Rajbari, Kolkata and Sreebhumi in Lake Town. https://t.co/bGvEDE5Jw8", "url": "https://x.com/Journo_Rajesh/status/2109912981446561810"}, {"author_id": "3868003454", "created_at": "2026-10-13T07:43:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109912846398271869"], "id": "2109912846398271869", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 21, "impression_count": 1570, "like_count": 45, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 4}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2109684043096965608", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "So there are some 3000 pandals in the city. Covering all of them won't be possible or practical. If you want to do just the big and famous one, even that would be some 200 pandals and on Ashtami/Navami visiting just one of them can eat up 5-6 hours. \n\nSo this needs planning. https://t.co/KYHxFmIMLJ", "url": "https://x.com/EducatedMoron/status/2109912846398271869"}, {"author_id": "1652663256144805889", "created_at": "2026-10-13T07:35:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109910804661493842"], "id": "2109910804661493842", "in_reply_to_user_id": "62868491", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2109581108530815054", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@BySabya @runkarthikrun Not necessarily , there have been many murtis of Ma that have been massive in size and scale (especially the Deshapriya park pujo which happened a few years back.)", "url": "https://x.com/SayantanDe40591/status/2109910804661493842"}, {"author_id": "4764615733", "created_at": "2026-10-13T07:04:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109903048978100541"], "id": "2109903048978100541", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 839, "like_count": 40, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 4}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2109678192474939723", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "There is a severe lack of interest by the public in this year's Durga Puja, owing to the veg fear, Sanatan imposition, and so on.\n\nConsequently, the investors are also reluctant despite government's assurance, leading to such empty bamboo scaffolding.\n\nIt is heartbreaking to see. https://t.co/kkvViNJRNA", "url": "https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2109903048978100541"}, {"author_id": "1812128031739396096", "created_at": "2026-10-13T06:59:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109901745665237451"], "id": "2109901745665237451", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1526603809635856384", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2109684043096965608", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Amit4Films Impossible to visit all pandals. One pandal namely Sribhumi near lake town will physically drain you.", "url": "https://x.com/lal_chotu16891/status/2109901745665237451"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2109895637361983488"]}, "author_id": "2075928017327865857", "created_at": "2026-10-13T06:35:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109895784175124650"], "id": "2109895784175124650", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#\u091f\u0940\u092c\